{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/they-came-from/beneath-the-sea/1484935-they-came-from-beneath-the-sea-weapons-in-jumpstart","id":1484935,"title":"[They Came From Beneath the Sea] Weapons in Jumpstart?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","They Came From...","...Beneath the Sea!"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-06-24T21:06:47-07:00","id":1484935,"title":"[They Came From Beneath the Sea] Weapons in Jumpstart?","content":"I know from Trinity Continuum that weapons carry an Enhancement value, but there are no weapon stats listed in the jumpstart. Am I missing something?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Host of <a href=\"http://www.fivepoles.com/podcast/\" target=\"_blank\">The Deliberative Podcast</a><br /> Host of <a href=\"https://tca.edennian.com\" target=\"_blank\">Trinity Continuum Airwaves</a><br /> Original Creator of the complete <a href=\"https://www.fantasygrounds.com/forums/showthread.php?9238-Rules-Lite-New-World-of-Darkness&amp;highlight=\" target=\"_blank\">nWoD conversion of Fantasy Grounds 2</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12730-pneumapilot","name":"PneumaPilot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12730_4.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"149"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-25T02:44:17-07:00","id":1484953,"title":"","content":"While both are based in the Storypath system, TCF uses a much more free form use of enahncements and tags than TC, so they are not 100% compatible as is.<br /> <br /> Worth comparing the injury system of each.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-25T03:31:20-07:00","id":1484956,"title":"","content":"Well, there are just no weapons listed at all in the jumpstart, nor any way given to even think about how they may work. Yet the players are definitely likely to get in some combat. If the injury system worked like Trinity, it would almost be no problem, since minor characters have only one injury condition: taken out. But in this jumpstart, the primary monster has 9 health boxes. It seems like weapons would need SOME KIND of enhancement value just to keep combat from going a hundred rounds.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Host of <a href=\"http://www.fivepoles.com/podcast/\" target=\"_blank\">The Deliberative Podcast</a><br /> Host of <a href=\"https://tca.edennian.com\" target=\"_blank\">Trinity Continuum Airwaves</a><br /> Original Creator of the complete <a href=\"https://www.fantasygrounds.com/forums/showthread.php?9238-Rules-Lite-New-World-of-Darkness&amp;highlight=\" target=\"_blank\">nWoD conversion of Fantasy Grounds 2</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12730-pneumapilot","name":"PneumaPilot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12730_4.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"149"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-25T10:11:10-07:00","id":1484973,"title":"","content":"I am quoting myself here to say \u201cWorth comparing the injury system of each.\u201d<br /> <br /> The injury system is different, 9 health boxes in TCF is not the same as 9 health boxes in TC.<br /> <br /> The idea of TCF is that weapons changes your attack, changing the kind of damage or adding extra effects to the system. A good weapon may add an enhancement, or even more, but it\u2019s not mandatory.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-25T11:20:35-07:00","id":1484976,"title":"","content":"We just skipped combat entirely because it was unplayable given the information provided in the jumpstart.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Host of <a href=\"http://www.fivepoles.com/podcast/\" target=\"_blank\">The Deliberative Podcast</a><br /> Host of <a href=\"https://tca.edennian.com\" target=\"_blank\">Trinity Continuum Airwaves</a><br /> Original Creator of the complete <a href=\"https://www.fantasygrounds.com/forums/showthread.php?9238-Rules-Lite-New-World-of-Darkness&amp;highlight=\" target=\"_blank\">nWoD conversion of Fantasy Grounds 2</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12730-pneumapilot","name":"PneumaPilot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12730_4.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"149"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-27T09:55:26-07:00","id":1485118,"title":"","content":"We didn't include weapon tags in the Jumpstart because it's a condensed system chapter. In the Jumpstart, it doesn't matter what weapon you're using: it's extra successes that add extra damage (with the appropriate Stunt on p.19). For the full section on weapon tags, you'll want to check the core book.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/They<br /> Moderator<br /> Line Developer: <b><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4261/Onyx-Path-Publishing/subcategory/8329_24824/Scarred-Lands-new\" target=\"_blank\">Scarred Lands</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25411-travislegge","name":"TravisLegge","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25411_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"227"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-27T11:50:30-07:00","id":1485125,"title":"","content":"In the actual book, does a pistol do more damage than a punch? In other words, does it have a higher enhancement, or maybe a different Scale, like in Trinity?<br /> <br /> I do plan on getting the core book at some point, because I did enjoy the game immensely, but I am curious as to the particulars of this iteration of the Storypath rules.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Host of <a href=\"http://www.fivepoles.com/podcast/\" target=\"_blank\">The Deliberative Podcast</a><br /> Host of <a href=\"https://tca.edennian.com\" target=\"_blank\">Trinity Continuum Airwaves</a><br /> Original Creator of the complete <a href=\"https://www.fantasygrounds.com/forums/showthread.php?9238-Rules-Lite-New-World-of-Darkness&amp;highlight=\" target=\"_blank\">nWoD conversion of Fantasy Grounds 2</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12730-pneumapilot","name":"PneumaPilot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12730_4.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"149"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-27T13:01:28-07:00","id":1485137,"title":"","content":"Weapons and Armor use tags in a fashion similar to those found in other Storypath games.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/They<br /> Moderator<br /> Line Developer: <b><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4261/Onyx-Path-Publishing/subcategory/8329_24824/Scarred-Lands-new\" target=\"_blank\">Scarred Lands</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25411-travislegge","name":"TravisLegge","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25411_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-na